_⚠️ Potential issue_ | _🟡 Minor_

**Deleted config paths can stay stale in `rootTsConfigs`.**

When a config is deleted but no project instance exists yet, the path is never removed from `rootTsConfigs`.


<details>
<summary>🩹 Suggested fix</summary>

```diff
   onConfigChanged(configPath: string, type: 'created' | 'changed' | 'deleted') {
     configPath = configPath.replace(/\\/g, '/');
     if (type === 'created') {
       this.rootTsConfigs.add(configPath);
-    } else if ((type === 'changed' || type === 'deleted') && this.configProjects.has(configPath)) {
-      if (type === 'deleted') {
-        this.rootTsConfigs.delete(configPath);
-      }
+    } else if (type === 'deleted') {
+      this.rootTsConfigs.delete(configPath);
+      if (!this.configProjects.has(configPath)) {
+        this.searchedDirs.clear();
+        return;
+      }
+      const project = this.configProjects.get(configPath);
+      this.configProjects.delete(configPath);
+      project?.dispose();
+    } else if (type === 'changed' && this.configProjects.has(configPath)) {
       const project = this.configProjects.get(configPath);
       this.configProjects.delete(configPath);
       project?.dispose();
     }
```
</details>

